### 2. Implement the `CryptoAlgorithm` enumeration

The `CryptoAlgorithm` enumeration is used to specify which cryptographic algorithm should be used for encryption and decryption. The enumeration consists of three values: `AES`, `RSA`, and `HMAC`.
```csharp
namespace Cryptography
{
    public enum CryptoAlgorithm : byte
    {
        AES = 0x1,
        RSA = 0x2,
        HMAC = 0x4,
        Encryption = AES | RSA,
        Signature = HMAC
    }
}
```
### 3. Implement the `ICryptoService` interface

The `ICryptoService` interface is used to provide a generic way for other components to interact with the cryptographic service. The interface consists of two methods: `Encrypt` and `Decrypt`. The `Encrypt` method takes an input string, encrypts it using one of the supported encryption algorithms, and returns the encrypted data as a byte array. The `Decrypt` method takes an input byte array, decrypts it using one of the supported encryption algorithms, and returns the original plain text as a string.
```csharp
namespace Cryptography
{
    public interface ICryptoService
    {
        byte[] Encrypt(string input);
        string Decrypt(byte[] input);
    }
}
```
### 4. Implement the `CryptoService` class

The `CryptoService` class is used to provide a concrete implementation of the `ICryptoService` interface. The class is responsible for encrypting and decrypting data using one of the supported encryption algorithms, depending on the value specified in the `CryptoAlgorithm` enumeration.
```csharp
namespace Cryptography
{
    public class CryptoService : ICryptoService
    {
        private readonly AesCryptoServiceProvider _aes;
        private readonly RsaCryptoServiceProvider _rsa;
        private readonly HmacSha256 _hmac;

        public CryptoService(CryptoAlgorithm algorithm)
        {
            switch (algorithm)
            {
                case CryptoAlgorithm.AES:
                    _aes = new AesCryptoServiceProvider();
                    break;
                case CryptoAlgorithm.RSA:
                    _rsa = new RsaCryptoServiceProvider();
                    break;
                case CryptoAlgorithm.HMAC:
                    _hmac = new HmacSha256();
                    break;
            }
        }

        public byte[] Encrypt(string input)
        {
            switch (Algorithm)
            {
                case CryptoAlgorithm.AES:
                    return _aes.Encrypt(input);
                case CryptoAlgorithm.RSA:
                    return _rsa.Encrypt(input);
                case CryptoAlgorithm.HMAC:
                    return _hmac.ComputeHash(Encoding.UTF8.GetBytes(input));
            }
        }

        public string Decrypt(byte[] input)
        {
            switch (Algorithm)
            {
                case CryptoAlgorithm.AES:
                    return _aes.Decrypt(input);
                case CryptoAlgorithm.RSA:
                    return _rsa.Decrypt(input);
                case CryptoAlgorithm.HMAC:
                    byte[] hash = new byte[32];
                    Array.Copy(input, 0, hash, 0, 32);
                    return Encoding.UTF8.GetString(hash);
            }
        }
    }
}
