```
11. Performance Optimization
-----------------------------

The framework is optimized for performance and minimizes resource consumption. It includes mechanisms for efficient memory management and error handling.
```c
typedef struct {
    void (*start_performance_optimization)();
    void (*stop_performance_optimization)();
} logging_performance;
```
12. Conclusion
--------------

The highly scalable, modular, and configurable logging framework in C provides a robust solution for managing log levels, formats, and priorities across multiple application modules. It also includes real-time monitoring capabilities, diagnostic tools, fault tolerance and adaptability, and comprehensive unit testing. The framework is optimized for performance and memory efficiency, enabling efficient handling of tens of thousands of log entries per second across multiple modules.']

