Here is an example of a modular, scalable C++ library that dynamically generates and manages unique file identifiers based on metadata and directory structure:
```c++
#include <iostream>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <chrono>
#include <thread>
#include <mutex>
#include <condition_variable>
