To adapt to different service SLAs and response times, we have designed the client to monitor and profile its performance to identify bottlenecks and optimize critical sections. We have also introduced a feature to dynamically switch between different service versions in case of failures, ensuring continuous operation while maintaining data consistency and latency.

Overall, this implementation is designed to be highly resilient, scalable, and adaptable to real-world constraints, providing the optimal balance between security, performance, and reliability.']

